OL,3,APolls remain open in Brazil
OL,4,Apresidential election after last-minute
OL,5,Aextension
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolls remain open in Brazil's closely
OL,8,Ffought presidential election run-off,
OL,9,Fafter the country's Supreme Court
OL,10,Fissued a last-minute extension to
OL,11,Fvoting hours
OL,13,FVoting was due to end at 17:00 local
OL,14,Ftime (20:00 GMT) - however both
OL,15,Fcampaigns asked for polls to remain
OL,16,Fopen longer in some cities
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
