OL,3,APolls remain open in Brazil
OL,4,Apresidential election after last-minute
OL,5,Aextension
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Luiz Inacio Lula da Silva
OL,8,Fclaimed public transport had been
OL,9,Fdisrupted in some cities, while his
OL,10,Fopponent Flavio Bolsonaro's campaign
OL,11,Fclaimed bad weather affected voters in
OL,12,Fa number of locations
OL,14,FThe vote will now close at 19:00 local
OL,15,Ftime nationwide - it's a highly unusual
OL,16,Fstep and could mean results are pushed
OL,17,Fback several hours, our correspondent
OL,18,Fin Brasilia writes
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
